<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-078-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.414165" lon="-120.96549"><name>SC26-078-B</name><cmt>SC26-078</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 8.8 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 64/100; not catch probability. Center 151 ft; nearby 146–177 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-064</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.423089692210894" lon="-120.96278711209418"/><trkpt lat="35.42284535924837" lon="-120.96433513832937"/><trkpt lat="35.42223314085405" lon="-120.96545187588904"/><trkpt lat="35.421778874398356" lon="-120.96524303787356"/><trkpt lat="35.42142585130948" lon="-120.96569244587079"/><trkpt lat="35.420975295637625" lon="-120.96570377743895"/><trkpt lat="35.4208666285499" lon="-120.96460519986364"/><trkpt lat="35.42113510561283" lon="-120.96448831261229"/><trkpt lat="35.42112953651697" lon="-120.96415805857919"/><trkpt lat="35.42103571224753" lon="-120.9639401575366"/><trkpt lat="35.42076537912602" lon="-120.9639469622637"/><trkpt lat="35.420678981253" lon="-120.96416939856668"/><trkpt lat="35.41977972698791" lon="-120.96430216061796"/><trkpt lat="35.41978900735094" lon="-120.96485257492493"/><trkpt lat="35.4206111407227